291
00:14:15,040 --> 00:14:16,570
I have no other intentions.

292
00:14:19,120 --> 00:14:19,840
My Lord.

293
00:14:20,120 --> 00:14:21,720
Lady Fang broke into the inn,

294
00:14:21,760 --> 00:14:23,360
causing a huge scandal.

295
00:14:23,400 --> 00:14:25,320
We really can't keep her anymore.

296
00:14:25,840 --> 00:14:26,400
Father,

297
00:14:26,600 --> 00:14:27,960
Lady Fang would never do that.

298
00:14:27,960 --> 00:14:28,640
Enough.

299
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:33,560
As the Master of the Commander's Mansion,

300
00:14:34,160 --> 00:14:35,560
losing your composure over a concubine

301
00:14:35,560 --> 00:14:36,600
like this,

302
00:14:36,600 --> 00:14:37,680
what a scandal.

303
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:43,000
Since this matter

304
00:14:43,480 --> 00:14:45,680
was started by Lady Fang alone...

305
00:14:47,240 --> 00:14:48,040
Men!

306
00:14:49,600 --> 00:14:50,080
Yes.

307
00:14:50,480 --> 00:14:53,120
Lady Fang trespassed the foreign envoy's inn,

308
00:14:53,520 --> 00:14:54,920
committing the crime of trespassing.

309
00:14:54,920 --> 00:14:56,720
Put her in prison to await trial.

310
00:14:56,760 --> 00:14:57,400
Yes.
